### Central Thesis
Wright's genius and his cruelty ran on the same engine — a Self-Preservation Seven's refusal to sit still inside pain, weaponized by an 8 wing into verdicts instead of apologies — and at ninety he admitted on camera that the arrogance holding it up was a shell he knew was a shell.

